## Code Standards
- Always test changes with both CPU and GPU configurations
- Maintain detailed docstrings with type hints
- Validate against sample GRS documents
- Keep DEVELOPMENT_PLAN_SOTA.md updated as tasks progress
- Prioritize semantic accuracy over processing speed

Before each commit, verify that DEVELOPMENT_PLAN_SOTA.md accurately reflects the current implementation status. 